  "heroSub": "70 statements on the issues defining Australia right now: Medicare, immigration, climate and energy, housing, and the cost of living. Every position is asked twice with opposite framing, revealing both your party alignment and your framing bias.",
  "partyStripHtml": "<div class=\"party-strip\">\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#CC0000\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Labor</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely match the Australian Labor Party. You favour workers rights, Medicare, clean energy transition, and a stronger role for government in reducing inequality.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#003DA5\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Liberal</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely match the Liberal Party. You favour lower taxes, smaller government, strong borders, and a market-led approach to the economy.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#006400\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Nationals</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely match the Nationals. You prioritise regional Australia, farming communities, resource industries, and scepticism of city-centric climate policy.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#008000\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Greens</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely match the Greens. You support treating climate as an emergency, ending fossil fuel extraction, wealth taxes, and strong renters rights.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#007777\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Teal Independents</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely match the Teal independents. You support strong integrity reforms, climate action, and pragmatic centrist economics, outside the major party blocs.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
